+## Subtle captions and content caches (helper 0.10.3)
+
+Explicit `cap.style=subtle` is independent of the title. It requires the exact new caption source, packaging cache and subtle renderer hashes, and pinned Inter Regular bytes. Missing support fails before finalize/upload. New template snapshots bind these dependencies and the caption font; prior snapshots remain immutable and require their compatible installed renderer. Process-local render caches are bounded at64MiB/256 entries and verify file identity/pinned hashes before completed-raster reuse.
 
